Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 18:02:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] init/adb: 3.18 msm8996 recovery fixes

- init: skip mmap_rnd_bits hardening when the sysctl is missing
- init: restorecon/init and property_set null guards
- init: skip SELinux initialization on this kernel
- init: breadcrumb markers and fatal-error persistence for debugging
- adb: adbd never drops privileges in recovery

Change-Id: I2a93736949717c9f964f0fd995c92033637d7f84
